{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55717","headline":"留题巾山明庆塔院 · 钱昱","name":"留题巾山明庆塔院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数级崔嵬万木中，最堪影势似难同。\n栏杆（《赤城志》作「阑干」）夜压江心月，铃铎秋摇岳顶风。\n重叠画檐遮世界，稀疎清磬彻虚空。\n有时问着禅僧路，笑指丹霄去不穷。\n（见《天台续集》卷下、《嘉定赤城志》卷十九。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}